  "title": "General Bathymetric Chart of the Oceans (GEBCO) from 2024",
  "description": "GEBCO_2024 is a global terrain model providing elevation and bathymetric depth data in meters at 15 arc-second resolution, covering both ocean floors and land surfaces. It includes a Type Identifier (TID) Grid indicating the source data types used in compilation, and incorporates under-ice topography and bathymetry for Greenland and Antarctica. This 2024 release has since been superseded by a multi-year version.",
